---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Contribute">
  <article class="container-prose py-16">
    <header class="mb-12 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="display mb-4">Contribute to Axomiya IT Labs</h1>
      <p class="lead">Help us build the future of open-source in Assam.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="content-prose mx-auto">
      <h2>How You Can Help</h2>
      <p>We welcome contributors of all skill levels. Whether you are a developer, designer, writer, or just someone passionate about Assam, there is a place for you here.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Code:</strong> Check our GitHub issues for open tasks.</li>
        <li><strong>Translate:</strong> Help us translate content into Assamese.</li>
        <li><strong>Write:</strong> Submit a guest post or research article.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Join our <a href="/community/">Telegram group</a> to get started.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>